# Recipe App

A personal recipe collection built around the idea that your recipes should belong to you.

This will be a place to collect, organize, and build on recipes. It's being designed to let people keep their recipes private, choose what they share, and create their own versions of recipes without losing the original.

## What We're Building

- **Your recipes, your choice.** Recipes are private by default. You decide what to publish.
- **Build on existing recipes.** Create your own versions while preserving the distinction between your recipe and the original.
- **A collection that belongs to you.** Keep your recipes together in one place and make them your own.

## Project Status

Recipe App is in active development. Features and functionality are still being built.
